								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=841.msg8090#msg8090">Re: SoE To Fix GoD?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> May 27, 2004, 03:52:10 pm &#187;</span></td>
